                <mxCell id="20" value="1.&amp;nbsp;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="19">
                    <mxGeometry y="30" width="310" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7" value="PM2 Actions" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#d0cee2;strokeColor=#56517e;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-70" y="585" width="370" height="400" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="8" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1. Directly start the ts/js file with pm2, default it starts the process in fork mode, Other mode: -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Clustor mode&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;rounded=0;" parent="7" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="30" width="370" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="18" value="2. we can also give the args, while the pm2 process" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="7">
                    <mxGeometry y="110" width="370" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="10" value="3. pm2 &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 0, 102));&quot;&gt;assigns index number&amp;nbsp; and name to all the started process&lt;/span&gt;, we can also &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 0, 51));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;give custom name&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;rounded=0;" parent="7" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="160" width="370" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="11" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4. Now using the process index or name we can: -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;start, stop, restart, delete, veiw snapshots of the pm2 saved process snapshot&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;view the logs of the process either running or saved&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Either perform these action on single, multiple or all(if applicatble) instances&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;rounded=0;" parent="7" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="210" width="370" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="17" value="5. Can pemanently&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 51, 51));&quot;&gt;save the snapshot(like all the data returned by pm2 show cmd) of the process&lt;/span&gt; managed by pm2" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;rounded=0;" parent="7" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="350" width="370" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="12" value="Problem (Why to use pm2)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-240" y="340" width="380" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="13" value="1. When our application crashes, pm2 will automatically start again&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Pm2 can also start, server even if the system reboots, if configed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;rounded=0;" parent="12" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="30" width="380" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
